{
	title: "Reactor Types",
	x: 19.5d,
	y: 6.0d,
	text: [
		"There are two to choose from Nuclear Reactor (NR) and Nuclear Breeder Reactor (NBR). ",
		"",
		"The NR simply turns the given fuels into their burnet counterparts, the NBR is a bit more complex, but generally speaking it turns some of the input fuels into higher tier burnet fuels which can help with the efficiency of your setup, more on the latter.",
		"Like many other things, to start with you most likely only have access to the simpler version but to upgrade you only need to swap the controllers so it’s not much trouble.",
		"",
		"The descriptions contain a lot of information, but you don’t have to worry about most of it, the reactors OC like normal multiblock with energy hatches, adding coolant is optional, it won’t explode or anything, it only serves to make a little power. Be warned0020they produce very very little power compared to any other option, I would consider it a mechanic purely for immersion or lore."
	],
